<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Large Language Models</title><link>https://jaehun.me/categories/large-language-models/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/categories/large-language-models/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[논문 리뷰] Hardware-Efficient Attention for Fast Decoding</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-hardware-efficient-attention-for-fast-decoding/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8-%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-hardware-efficient-attention-for-fast-decoding/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 23 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21487v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="gta--gla-디코딩의-메모리-지배를-깨는-하드웨어-효율-어텐션"&gt;GTA &amp;amp; GLA: 디코딩의 ‘메모리-지배’를 깨는 하드웨어 효율 어텐션&lt;a href="#gta--gla-%eb%94%94%ec%bd%94%eb%94%a9%ec%9d%98-%eb%a9%94%eb%aa%a8%eb%a6%ac-%ec%a7%80%eb%b0%b0%eb%a5%bc-%ea%b9%a8%eb%8a%94-%ed%95%98%eb%93%9c%ec%9b%a8%ec%96%b4-%ed%9a%a8%ec%9c%a8-%ec%96%b4%ed%85%90%ec%85%98" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="tldr"&gt;TL;DR&lt;a href="#tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTA(키·값 타이잉)와 GLA(잠재 헤드 샤딩)&lt;/strong&gt; 으로 &lt;strong&gt;FLOPs/byte&lt;/strong&gt;를 끌어올리고 &lt;strong&gt;per-GPU KV 캐시&lt;/strong&gt;를 줄여, &lt;strong&gt;품질 손실 없이&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;커널 1.2–2× 가속&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;서빙 지연 대폭↓&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;처리량 최대 2×↑&lt;/strong&gt; 를 달성한다. (근거: §Abstract, Fig.4–5, Fig.15, Tab.38–41)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>